  "given": {"O": "The centre of a star.", "A": "Halfway from O to the next star."},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rule a horizontal line and draw a circle on it about the centre O, through A. A star sits at O and at every point two radii away on a triangular grid.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Keep the compass open. Put its point on A and on the point opposite, P180, and draw circles through O: they cut the first circle at 60°, 120°, 240° and 300°. Rule the lines through O and these points.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Keep the compass open. Put its point on A and on the point opposite, P180, and draw circles through O: they cut the first circle at 60°, 120°, 240° and 300°.",
      "create": {
        "P180": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "cE": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "through": "O"}},
        "cW": {"circle": {"centre": "P180", "through": "O"}},
        "P60": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cE"], "pick": {"angle": 60.0}}},
        "P300": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cE"], "pick": {"angle": 300.0}}},
        "P120": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cW"], "pick": {"angle": 120.0}}},
        "P240": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "cW"], "pick": {"angle": 240.0}}},
        "r60": {"line": {"through": ["P60", "P240"]}},
        "r120": {"line": {"through": ["P120", "P300"]}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rule the vertical through O, and halve the angle between the horizontal and the 60° line: the 30° line. With them there is a line through O every 30°.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "r30": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["A", "O", "P60"]}},
        "P30": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r30"], "pick": {"angle": 30.0}}},
        "P90": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Join the six points at 0°, 60°, 120° and so on: a hexagon. Its sides, carried on, are lines of the pattern.",
      "create": {
        "hx0": {"line": {"through": ["A", "P60"]}},
        "hx60": {"line": {"through": ["P60", "P120"]}},
        "hx120": {"line": {"through": ["P120", "P180"]}},
        "hx180": {"line": {"through": ["P180", "P240"]}},
        "hx240": {"line": {"through": ["P240", "P300"]}},
        "hx300": {"line": {"through": ["P300", "A"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The tile is the hexagon whose sides touch the circle at 0°, 60°, 120° and so on: rule the line at right angles to each of those six lines through O, where it meets the circle.",
      "create": {
        "g0": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "g60": {"line": {"through": "P60", "perpendicularTo": "r60"}},
        "g120": {"line": {"through": "P120", "perpendicularTo": "r120"}},
        "g180": {"line": {"through": "P180", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "g240": {"line": {"through": "P240", "perpendicularTo": "r60"}},
        "g300": {"line": {"through": "P300", "perpendicularTo": "r120"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["g0", "g60"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["g60", "g120"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["g120", "g180"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["g180", "g240"]}},
        "K5": {"point": {"meet": ["g240", "g300"]}},
        "K6": {"point": {"meet": ["g300", "g0"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Find the star’s size. The verticals through P60 and P30 meet the horizontal at X and Y; the distance XY is the radius of the star’s points. Draw the circle about O with that radius, then halve it: the circle about O through its crossing with the line halfway between O and its edge.",
      "create": {
        "vx": {"line": {"through": "P60", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vy": {"line": {"through": "P30", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "X": {"point": {"meet": ["vx", "h"]}},
        "Y": {"point": {"meet": ["vy", "h"]}},
        "cp": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "radiusFrom": ["X", "Y"]}},
        "Q": {"point": {"meet": ["cp", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "cq": {"circle": {"centre": "Q", "through": "O"}},
        "Q1": {"point": {"meet": ["cq", "cp"], "pick": {"angle": 60.0}}},
        "Q2": {"point": {"meet": ["cq", "cp"], "pick": {"angle": 300.0}}},
        "qm": {"line": {"through": ["Q1", "Q2"]}},
        "T0": {"point": {"meet": ["qm", "h"]}},
        "cd": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "T0"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Where this small circle meets the horizontal and the 30° line, rule lines at right angles to them: they touch the circle. Turn them about O to every 30°: twelve lines round the star.",
      "create": {
        "t0": {"line": {"through": "T0", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "T30": {"point": {"meet": ["cd", "r30"], "pick": {"angle": 30.0}}},
        "t30": {"line": {"through": "T30", "perpendicularTo": "r30"}},
        "tr": {"repeat": {"of": ["t0", "t30"], "by": "rot6"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["cd"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The neighbouring star along the horizontal sits at the far side of the circle about A through O. Carry the twelve lines over to it: through the points as far from that star as T0 is from O, rule lines parallel to O’s twelve lines.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "The neighbouring star along the horizontal sits at the far side of the circle about A through O. Carry over to it the lines the pattern runs along: through the points as far from that star as T0 is from O, rule lines parallel to O’s lines.",
      "create": {
        "N": {"point": {"meet": ["cE", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cn": {"circle": {"centre": "N", "radiusFrom": ["O", "T0"]}},
        "nr0": {"line": {"through": "N", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "NP0": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr0"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "nt0": {"line": {"through": "NP0", "perpendicularTo": "nr0"}},
        "nr30": {"line": {"through": "N", "parallelTo": "r30"}},
        "NP30": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr30"], "pick": {"angle": 2.428}}},
        "nt30": {"line": {"through": "NP30", "perpendicularTo": "nr30"}},
        "nr60": {"line": {"through": "N", "parallelTo": "r60"}},
        "NP60": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr60"], "pick": {"angle": 4.334}}},
        "nt60": {"line": {"through": "NP60", "perpendicularTo": "nr60"}},
        "nr90": {"line": {"through": "N", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "NP90": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr90"], "pick": {"angle": 5.228}}},
        "nt90": {"line": {"through": "NP90", "perpendicularTo": "nr90"}},
        "nr120": {"line": {"through": "N", "parallelTo": "r120"}},
        "NP120": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr120"], "pick": {"angle": 4.747}}},
        "nt120": {"line": {"through": "NP120", "perpendicularTo": "nr120"}},
        "r150n": {"line": {"through": "N", "perpendicularTo": "r60"}},
        "NP150": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "r150n"], "pick": {"angle": 2.845}}},
        "nt150": {"line": {"through": "NP150", "perpendicularTo": "r150n"}},
        "NP180": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr0"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "nt180": {"line": {"through": "NP180", "perpendicularTo": "nr0"}},
        "NP210": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr30"], "pick": {"angle": 357.155}}},
        "nt210": {"line": {"through": "NP210", "perpendicularTo": "nr30"}},
        "NP240": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr60"], "pick": {"angle": 355.253}}},
        "nt240": {"line": {"through": "NP240", "perpendicularTo": "nr60"}},
        "NP270": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr90"], "pick": {"angle": 354.772}}},
        "nt270": {"line": {"through": "NP270", "perpendicularTo": "nr90"}},
        "NP300": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "nr120"], "pick": {"angle": 355.666}}},
        "nt300": {"line": {"through": "NP300", "perpendicularTo": "nr120"}},
        "NP330": {"point": {"meet": ["cn", "r150n"], "pick": {"angle": 357.572}}},
        "nt330": {"line": {"through": "NP330", "perpendicularTo": "r150n"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["A"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Turn these lines about O to the other five neighbours.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Turn these lines about O to the other five neighbours.",
      "create": {
        "nr": {
          "repeat": {
            "of": [
